1
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:24,260
Worst. Heroes. Ever.

2
00:10:36,521 --> 00:10:42,521
Suicide Squad is a action, adventure, fantasy film directed by David Ayer.

3
00:15:54,782 --> 00:16:00,782
From DC Comics comes the Suicide Squad, an antihero team of incarcerated supervillains who act as deniable assets for the
United States government, undertaking high-risk black ops missions in exchange for commuted prison sentences.

4
00:21:13,043 --> 00:21:19,043
Deadshot, played by Will Smith.

5
00:26:31,304 --> 00:26:37,304
The Joker, played by Jared Leto.

6
00:31:49,565 --> 00:31:55,565
Harley Quinn, played by Margot Robbie.

7
00:37:07,826 --> 00:37:13,826
Rick Flag, played by Joel Kinnaman.

8
00:42:26,086 --> 00:42:32,086
Amanda Waller, played by Viola Davis.

9
00:47:44,347 --> 00:47:50,347
Boomerang, played by Jai Courtney.

10
00:53:02,608 --> 00:53:08,608
Suicide Squad is a 2016 American superhero film based on the
supervillain/anti-hero team from DC Comics.

11
00:58:20,869 --> 00:58:26,869
It is the third installment in the DC Extended Universe (DCEU).

12
01:03:39,130 --> 01:03:45,130
The film was written and directed by David Ayer and stars an ensemble cast including Will Smith, Jared Leto, Margot Robbie, Joel Kinnaman,
Viola Davis, Jai Courtney, Jay Hernandez, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Ike Barinholtz, Scott Eastwood, and Cara Delevingne.

13
01:08:57,391 --> 01:09:03,391
In the film, a secret government agency led by Amanda Waller recruits imprisoned supervillains to execute
dangerous black ops missions and save the world from a powerful threat in exchange for reduced sentences.

14
01:14:15,652 --> 01:14:21,652
By February 2009, a Suicide Squad film was in development at Warner Bros.

15
01:19:33,913 --> 01:19:39,913
Ayer signed on to write and direct in September 2014, and
by October the casting process had begun.

16
01:24:52,173 --> 01:24:58,173
Principal photography began in Toronto on April 13, 2015, with
additional filming in Chicago, and ended in August that year.

17
01:30:10,434 --> 01:30:16,434
Suicide Squad premiered in New York City on August 1, 2016, and was
released in the United States on August 5 by Warner Bros.

18
01:35:28,695 --> 01:35:34,695
It grossed $749 million on a budget of $175 million, becoming the
tenth-highest-grossing film of 2016, and received mixed reviews from critics.

19
01:40:46,956 --> 01:40:52,956
Ayer himself disowned the film after its release, claiming that
extensive studio interference had ruined his vision.

20
01:46:05,217 --> 01:46:11,217
It won an Academy Award for Best Makeup and Hairstyling at the 89th Academy Awards, making it the
only DCEU film to have won an Academy Award, and received numerous other accolades.

21
01:51:23,478 --> 01:51:29,478
It was followed by a spin-off film, Birds of Prey (2020),
and a sequel, The Suicide Squad (2021).

22
01:56:41,739 --> 01:56:47,739
The film explores themes of secret mission,
superhero, anti hero, villain, supervillain.
